<title>CHINA: HK weather - overcast with rain, thunderstorms.</title>
<headline>HK weather - overcast with rain, thunderstorms.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weather in Hong Kong will be unsettled and overcast with rain, heavy at times, the Hong Kong Observatory said on Friday.</p>
<p>There will also be squally thunderstorms. Daytime temperatures will be about 27 C.</p>
<p>Outlook for Saturday: occasional heavy rain.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m. the temperature was 27 C and the relative humidity 90 percent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
